        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "第一种叫破：指崩破峰垄、断冈坏堑的地方，或是被流水冲损、被霹雳惊扰的区域。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
